{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simond-alpinism-and-vertika-quickdraws-2608-0029","content_id":"0314b468-7a11-444f-8274-5914dd23cd57","description":"Product Recall for SIMOND Alpinism & Vertika Quickdraws  presenting a serious risk of injuries.\r\n","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"b4f3fae2-3cb5-4d55-80cd-3f010e46187f","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-11T14:29:05+01:00","id":"b4f3fae2-3cb5-4d55-80cd-3f010e46187f","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-11T14:29:05+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7b23a1783bd442d7805c36/2608-0029-product-recall-SIMOND-alpinism-and-vertika-quickdraws.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: SIMOND Alpinism &amp; Vertika Quickdraws</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The wire gate riveting on the carabiners may break or detach. If this occurs while the product is in use at height, the user could fall and receive serious injuries.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Decathlon.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Trekking/Mountaineering Sports Equipment</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>SIMOND</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales period</td>\n      <td>1 January 2022 to 23 July 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>France</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Multiple models of carabiners for use in climbing. Please see Annex A for further product details.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_b4f3fae2-3cb5-4d55-80cd-3f010e46187f\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7b23a1783bd442d7805c36/2608-0029-product-recall-SIMOND-alpinism-and-vertika-quickdraws.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"annex-a\">Annex A</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Model</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Code</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Alpinism Quickdraw 11 cm</td>\n      <td>4051175</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Alpinism Quickdraw 17 cm</td>\n      <td>4051176</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Pack of 5 Alpinism Quickdraws</td>\n      <td>4171656</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Vertika Quickdraw 11 cm</td>\n      <td>5499689</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Vertika Quickdraw 17 cm</td>\n      <td>5500194</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The wire gate riveting on the carabiners may break or detach. If this occurs while the product is in use at height, the user could fall and receive serious injuries.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of Regulation 2016/425 on Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Decathlon.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers should stop using their affected quickdraw immediately and return it to any Decathlon store for a full refund. For more information, contact Decathlon Customer Relations on +44 (0)748 306 8343/ <a href=\"mailto:customer.enquiries@decathlon.com\">customer.enquiries@decathlon.com</a> or visit: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.decathlon.co.uk/c/lp/product-recall_60e7cb1a-0be0-4a29-a87d-e41b0cbc8395\">Product recall</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2608-0029</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-11T14:45:52Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"annex-a","level":3,"text":"Annex A"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-11","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-11T15:45:52+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simond-alpinism-and-vertika-quickdraws-2608-0029","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simond-alpinism-and-vertika-quickdraws-2608-0029","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simond-alpinism-and-vertika-quickdraws-2608-0029","content_id":"0314b468-7a11-444f-8274-5914dd23cd57","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-11T14:45:52Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: SIMOND Alpinism & Vertika Quickdraws  (2608-0029)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simond-alpinism-and-vertika-quickdraws-2608-0029","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value"